{"4442400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vanishing In The Island Halphéra", "steam_appid": 4442400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An apocalypse looms, but only within a restricted, isolated area unknown to the rest of the population. A group of skeptical professional researchers, armed with legends and studies, decides to personally verify the existence of the island of Halphéra… but something goes terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient secrets lie hidden among lush forests, while supernatural creatures relentlessly hunt you in a post-apocalyptic world. The line between life and death is thin, and every step could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts, spirits, and dark entities inhabit a world ruled by the abyss, ready to challenge you with deadly puzzles and combat. Use strategy and strength to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Living and Dangerous World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forests, mountains, caves, and ancient ruins conceal secrets, treasures, and supernatural threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442400/extras/82b5c8ceb09033d3f07c478d5de70d7d.avif?t=1776192597\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting and Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create weapons, shelters, tools, and gather resources to adapt to any threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442400/extras/98d67bb41e77ab31882cd863fb40ad86.avif?t=1776192597\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Armed and Ruthless Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an order of bandits who have taken advantage of the apocalypse for their own ruthless purposes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Souls-Meets-Survival Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense yet strategic combat, resource management, and survival tactics—only those who plan carefully will endure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets and Hidden Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind ancient legends and dark mysteries as you explore every corner of Halphéra and search for a way to restore the world to normal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All in One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title blends a wide variety of gameplay systems inspired by world-famous games, combining exploration, combat, crafting, and mystery into a single, unique experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every night is a fight.</strong><br><strong>Every choice can cost you your life.</strong><br><strong>Are you ready to survive this endless nightmare?</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An apocalypse looms, but only within a restricted, isolated area unknown to the rest of the population. A group of skeptical professional researchers, armed with legends and studies, decides to personally verify the existence of the island of Halphéra… but something goes terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient secrets lie hidden among lush forests, while supernatural creatures relentlessly hunt you in a post-apocalyptic world. The line between life and death is thin, and every step could be your last.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Supernatural Encounters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts, spirits, and dark entities inhabit a world ruled by the abyss, ready to challenge you with deadly puzzles and combat. Use strategy and strength to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Living and Dangerous World</stron